為什麼：register_witness() 令 _check_kernel_witness() 在每次 KV 寫入時對一個
延遲配置的 tensor 做 tensor[0].item()（GPU→CPU 同步）。2026-09-14 的段錯誤
調查把此路徑列為嫌疑；閘門關閉後崩潰點搬位而非消除，故判定它非肇事者，
但仍是每步的效能成本。生產實際上一直以閘門關閉的狀態運行。

改動：未設 SGL_WITNESS 即直接 return。行為與生產現狀一致；設 SGL_WITNESS=1
可重新啟用（rollback 不需改碼）。

影響：無行為改變（生產已等效運行此版本）；目的在於令 HEAD 與生產源碼一致。
---
 python/sglang/srt/utils/async_probe.py | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/utils/async_probe.py b/python/sglang/srt/utils/async_probe.py
index 607bb8c..8659c76 100644
--- a/python/sglang/srt/utils/async_probe.py
+++ b/python/sglang/srt/utils/async_probe.py
@@ -111,6 +111,12 @@ _WITNESS: dict = {}
 
 
 def register_witness(tensor: torch.Tensor, kernel_names: dict):
+    # 2026-09-14: gated OFF by default. This registry makes _check_kernel_witness()
+    # dereference a lazily-allocated tensor on EVERY KV write via tensor[0].item(),
+    # which is implicated in the hsa_signal_load_relaxed segfaults (see
+    # docs/APPORT-SWAP-EXHAUSTION-20260914.md). Set SGL_WITNESS=1 to re-enable.
+    if not os.environ.get("SGL_WITNESS"):
+        return
     _WITNESS[tensor.device.index or 0] = (tensor, kernel_names)
 
 
